TITLE: Yggdrasil — Non-Transformer, Non-Token-Centric North Star Addendum
DATE: 2026-10-20
STATUS: PROSPECTIVE GOVERNANCE ALIGNMENT (NOT YET LIVE-CHARTER PIN)
TRACK: DG-1
PROVENANCE: operator decision; Mind-Palace main 5e7414966bdcb6e75776ea3422b98422b20c9025

PROGRAM BOUNDARY
Develop Yggdrasil as a genuinely independent, natively learning, developmental/regenerative artificial cognitive architecture. The objective is LLM-class or greater general intelligence, not an external language model with a developmental attachment.

Transformers, conventional token-by-token autoregressive language models and token-centric predictors MAY NOT serve as Yggdrasil's cognitive foundation. Native internal state must provide memory, continual learning, relational/causal reasoning, unfamiliar compositional generalization, adaptive learning, functional development and bounded repair/regeneration. Language interfaces, discrete symbols and conventional models as teachers/controls/scaffolds remain permissible but do not count as achieved native cognitive capability.

Do not collapse Yggdrasil into Wingless: preserve distinct genome/phenotype development, local specialization, resource-bounded selective growth, functional recovery and accumulated memory. Benchmark synthetic mechanisms without treating them as completion; integrate qualified mechanisms into the actual cognitive substrate.

EXPERIMENT INTERPRETATION
DG-1G frozen pretrained seed and DG-1H adapter-based populations are intermediate tests against conventional systems, not the target architecture. Any result must separate competence supplied by the frozen seed from competence generated by Yggdrasil. No claim of standalone native intelligence may rely on an external/frozen model's inference as an undeclared core.

Qualification retains frozen evidence, resource-matched comparators, complete negatives, exact origin/first-use provenance, and deterministic regression. No retroactive reinterpretation of past trials.

IDENTITY AND EXECUTION
Existing ACTIVE charter research/architecture/yggdrasil-north-star.ice and its SHA-256 pins are unchanged by this addendum. This prospective document is not itself active research authority, permission to dispatch, or a substitute for a separately qualified atomic charter/pin transition.
